<font size=10 style=b>enyahloth<font size=10 style=n> [enyaloT] (n.) sickly one.

<font size=10 style=b>er'<font size=10 style=n> [er'] a common prefix for Ages used by the Guild of Caterers for harvesting food (e.g. Er'cana, Er'duna, Er'jera).

<font size=10 style=b>erem<font size=10 style=n> [erem] (n.) skill.

<font size=10 style=b>erth<font size=10 style=n> [erT] (art.) a, an.

