                <translation language="English"><![CDATA[<cover src="DniDictDE2.hsm"><font size=12 style=b face=courier color=000000><margin right=56 left=56 top=40 bottom=40><PB><p align=center>

D'ni to English Dictionary: J-P



<font size=12 style=n>Compiled by
Kh'reestrefah

Edited by
Korov'ev<PB>

<font style=b><p align=center>Abbreviations

<font size=10 style=n><p align=left>                   adj: adjective
                   adv: adverb
                   art: article
                   aux: auxiliary
                    cf: compare
                  conj: conjunction
                determ: determinative
                   fut: future
                     n: noun
                   num: number
                  perf: perfect
                  pers: person
                  plur: plural
                  pref: prefix
                  prep: preposition
                  pres: present
                  prog: progressive
                  pron: pronoun
               quantif: quantifier
                  sing: singular
                  suff: suffix
                     v: verb
<font size=12><PB>

<font style=b><p align=center>Sorting

<font size=10 style=n><p align=left>The traditional D'ni alphabetical order is the following:

               V   B   T   S   SH
               J   G   Y   KH  K
               AH  AI  F   P   I
               EE  E   AY  R   M
               TH  DH  D   H   O
               OY  CH  W   UH  OO
               TS  L   A   Z   N

However, to make looking for terms easier, in this dictionary we adopted the common alphabetical order:

<font size=12 style=b>        <a href=#J>J<a link=clear>  <a href=#K>K<a link=clear>  <a href=#L>L<a link=clear>  <a href=#M>M<a link=clear>  <a href=#N>N<a link=clear>  <a href=#O>O<a link=clear>  <a href=#P>P<a link=clear>

<font size=10 style=n>Dnifont spellings are given in brackets: [Sora]. Tentative translations are marked with: (?).<PB><PB>

