<font size=10 style=b>memondama<font size=10 style=n> (v.) remember.

<font size=10 style=b>nah<font size=10 style=n> (prep.) with.

<font size=10 style=b>Naray<font size=10 style=n> (n.) Narayan Age.

<font size=10 style=b>nilashahn<font size=10 style=n> (n.) annihilation.

<font size=10 style=b>nosis<font size=10 style=n> (v.) "I think".

<font size=10 style=b>revilani<font size=10 style=n> (n.) revelation.

<font size=10 style=b>soule<font size=10 style=n> (n.) soul, heart.

<font size=10 style=b>yan<font size=10 style=n> (v.) (?).


